WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:07.360
Where were Ant-man and the Wasps?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.600
Did you see them? I didn't see them.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.560
Where was "Tic-Tac"?

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.600
Good question.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.440
No, I mean, really I have no idea.

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:16.640
I mean, I don't remember being asked to be in their movie.

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:17.280
Just saying ..

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.520
Maybe they were on their way, but they went subatomic.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:20.480
Maybe they were there

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:24.640
but they were pretty tiny and there were definitely some ants in Wakanda, so ...

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:27.200
Maybe they're in the same place of Hawkeye.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:28.480
Gamora, Thor

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:29.440
Spider-man

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:30.720
I was

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:33.280
really looking forward to meeting the Wasp.

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:34.100
Yeah. No, not there.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:34.880
Weird.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:45.440
I just have one question

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:47.360
When Cap needed help

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:50.240
If I'd asked you would you've come?

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.800
I guess we'll never know

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:57.280
But if you had you'd've never been caught

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:07.520
I do some dumb things and the people I love the most they pay the price

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:11.680
Thanks to you we had to run

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.120
We're still running. Let's go.

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:49.120
Maybe you just need someone watching your back, like a partner

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:59.040
Hold on, you gave her wings

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:00.000
and blasters

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:04.240
So I take it you didn't have that tech available for me

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:05.080
No, I did

